data 325
Article 110 Receiving and examining evidence produced by the parties
The judge must in all cases receive and examine all incriminating or exculpatory evidence produced by the parties to support their arguments.
Chapter: CHAPTER ONE: PROSECUTION OF THE ACCUSED AT THE FIRST INSTANCE
Section: Section 3: Production of evidence

