data 436
Article 115: Suspension of proceedings in civil action
Proceedings in civil action is suspended until the criminal case is finally adjudicated, if the criminal action was instituted before or in the course of civil proceedings in accordance with the provisions of the Law determining jurisdiction of courts.
Chapter: CHAPTER ONE: PROSECUTION OF THE ACCUSED AT THE FIRST INSTANCE
Section: Section 4: Civil action arising from an offence

