data 370
Article 141: Obligation of indicating the competent court
If a court rules that it does not have jurisdiction to hear the case, it must immediately inform the accused of the court competent to hear the case and forward the case file to that court.
Chapter: CHAPTER ONE: PROSECUTION OF THE ACCUSED AT THE FIRST INSTANCE
Section: Section 8: Pronouncement of the judgement

