data 354
Article 230: Instrument through which presidential pardon is granted
The presidential pardon is granted through a presidential order.
Chapter: CHAPTER II: GROUNDS FOR SUSPENSION OF THE EXECUTION OF A PENALTY AND REMOVAL OF A PENALTY
