Article 3: Incorporation
One or more persons may form a company by pooling together resources or services for business purposes and filling out a prescribed form developed by the Registrar General in accordance with the provisions of this Law.
Chapter: CHAPTER II: INCORPORATION, CAPACITY AND FUNCTIONING OF A COMPANY
Section: Section One: Incorporation

