data 452
Article 169: Incapacity to vote on the part of director
Subject to the incorporation documents of a company, a director who is interested in a transaction entered into or to be entered into by the company does not vote on a directors' resolution. Where he or she votes, the vote is invalid.
Chapter: CHAPTER V: MANAGEMENT AND ADMINISTRATION
