mark :818
original-oid 5d04ac4b4dbe5b1dcd53bc0351d8f1990d86e3ab
data 233
Article 265: Non-declaration as a dormant company
A company that carries out banking activities cannot be declared a dormant company.
Chapter: CHAPTER XII: LIMITED LIFE COMPANY AND DORMANT COMPANY
Section: Section 2: Dormant company

